"Buying berths." Vance repeats it flatly, thumb still on the screen. "Funny. Three of those cancelled moorings were theirs, paid up and never used." He scrolls back, finds the line, and turns the screen a few degrees toward you. His other hand has gone to the edge of the desk and stays there.

"Reyes docks in ten minutes," he adds. "Whatever you plan to ask her, ask it fast."

*Pressing him on why the Ascendancy leaves berths empty would be a Compel.*

